# Improved SMPL (0.4.0-experimental): the SMPL key always shows SMPL WAVEFORM. From AMP, SMPL opens
# the waveform view; a second and a third press of SMPL stay on it (stock toggles to the knob view).
# Compares the body (y 9 to 55) with a reference of the waveform view. Changes nothing saved.
name: sample-rate-smpl-waveform
state: safe

hold TRK
key BD
release TRK
key AMP
wait 300
key SMPL
wait 3500
screen first
expect first == ref region 0 9 128 46
key SMPL
wait 3500
screen second
expect second == first region 0 9 128 46
key SMPL
wait 3500
screen third
expect third == first region 0 9 128 46
